    "title": "Habit Burger & Grill",
    "description": "With the Habit Burger & Grill app, savor your chargrilled favorites faster than ever\u2014freshly made to order and ready when you are. Enjoy a seamless experience with our app's top features:\r\n \r\nFeatures:\r\nSKIP THE LINE: Order ahead for quick pick-up and track your order in real-time. No more waiting\u2014just pick up and enjoy!\r\n \r\nCUSTOMIZE YOUR MEAL: Tailor every detail of your meal to perfection. Our made-to-order approach ensures your food is just the way you like it.\r\n \r\nSAVE YOUR FAVES: Quickly reorder your top picks by saving them in the app for faster, easier future ordering.\r\n \r\nPAY ONLINE: Complete your payment in advance so you can simply pick up your meal and dig in\u2014no fuss, no hassle.\r\n \r\nJOIN THE HABIT CHARCLUB: Be the first to hear about new menu items, exclusive promotions, and restaurant events by joining this delicious club.\r\n \r\nFIND A LOCATION: Easily locate the nearest Habit Burger & Grill, get directions, and check our hours of operation.",
